            "settings" => "M12 15a3 3 0 1 0 0-6 3 3 0 0 0 0 6Z|M19.4 15a1.6 1.6 0 0 0 .3 1.8l.1.1a2 2 0 1 1-2.8 2.8l-.1-.1a1.6 1.6 0 0 0-2.7 1.1V21a2 2 0 0 1-4 0v-.1A1.6 1.6 0 0 0 7 19.4a1.6 1.6 0 0 0-1.8.3l-.1.1a2 2 0 1 1-2.8-2.8l.1-.1A1.6 1.6 0 0 0 2.6 14H2a2 2 0 0 1 0-4h.1A1.6 1.6 0 0 0 4 7a1.6 1.6 0 0 0-.3-1.8l-.1-.1a2 2 0 1 1 2.8-2.8l.1.1A1.6 1.6 0 0 0 9 2.6V2a2 2 0 0 1 4 0v.1A1.6 1.6 0 0 0 17 4l.1-.1a2 2 0 1 1 2.8 2.8l-.1.1A1.6 1.6 0 0 0 21.4 9H22a2 2 0 0 1 0 4h-.1a1.6 1.6 0 0 0-1.5 2Z",
